61
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,870
I can't even use the token to enter the Celestial Cave.

62
00:05:52,960 --> 00:05:53,870
This place

63
00:05:55,280 --> 00:05:56,950
is actually a dead end.

64
00:06:11,960 --> 00:06:12,310
Wh...

65
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:13,710
What is that lightning

66
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,230
in your eyes !?

67
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:19,230
Back then, you said you knew the Tide Abyss very well

68
00:06:19,840 --> 00:06:21,870
