69
00:06:23,080 --> 00:06:24,110
This place...

70
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,390
Where are we ?

71
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:29,950
The...

72
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:31,070
The bottom of the Abyss !

73
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,960
I only ever scouted on the periphery.

74
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,520
I never thought I'd come to the bottom !

75
00:06:39,920 --> 00:06:41,350
I don't know how to get out either !

76
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,030
Useless.

77
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:44,350
Wait !

78
00:06:44,760 --> 00:06:45,920
I don't know the way out

79
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,430
