80
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,560
As long as you're willing to release me,

81
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,390
I will tell you !

82
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,000
Speak.

83
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:56,070
You

84
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,470
must swear on your Dao Heart !

85
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:01,870
I saw Master devour Sun Yun !

86
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:05,840
For a long time,

87
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:08,070
disciples of the Heavenly Fate Sect rarely reached the 2nd step.

88
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,790
There are many speculations about this.

89
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:11,030
Among them

90
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,750
the most widespread theory is

91
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:15,630
that the All-Seer refines his own domain

92
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,110
by devouring his 2nd step disciples.

93
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,230
I didn't believe it at the time

94
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,670
until that day.

95
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:24,190
The technique I cultivate can absorb spiritual energy from beasts.

96
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,550
That day,

97
00:07:25,760 --> 00:07:27,070
while I was devouring a mountain spirit beast,

98
00:07:27,760 --> 00:07:29,790
I unintentionally saw its memories.

99
00:07:30,400 --> 00:07:32,150
That mountain spirit beast had witnessed

100
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,070
the battle between Master and Sun Yun

101
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,150
with its own eyes.

102
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:38,150
Back then, the two were dueling in the sky.

103
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:41,190
Initially, Sun Yun could fight Master to a draw.

104
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,870
But at the critical moment,

105
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,350
a strange mark lit up on Sun Yun's forehead

106
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,670
which caused him to lose instantly.

107
00:07:48,520 --> 00:07:49,630
And the next second,

108
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:52,270
he was devoured alive by Master !

109
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,830
In that moment, I understood

110
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,710
that those terrible rumors

111
00:07:57,560 --> 00:07:58,390
were all true.

112
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,950
A strange mark ?

113
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,110
Was it this one ?

114
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,230
Exactly !

115
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,870
At that time,

116
00:08:08,560 --> 00:08:09,910
was Master wearing a gray robe ?

117
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,310
It was gray !

118
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,150
I did find it a bit strange,

119
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:15,920
I had never seen Master wear a gray robe before !

120
00:08:16,280 --> 00:08:17,990
Back in the Ancient Demon Inheritance,

121
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:20,710
I already sensed this slaughter energy was problematic.

122
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:24,510
Sun Yun must have seen through the All-Seer's scheme before that

123
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:27,540
which is why he didn't cultivate it to completion.

124
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:30,590
But he still couldn't escape being devoured...

125
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:32,470
It looks like

126
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:35,070
the spells the All-Seer passes on to his disciples

127
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,470
are also the shackles he places on them.

128
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:39,680
I can't stay on Planet Tian Yun

129
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:40,710
any longer.

130
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,830
This person is ruthless.

131
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,110
I can't just wait for death here !

132
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,400
Unfortunately, my cultivation is too low.

133
00:08:51,560 --> 00:08:52,510
But...

134
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,630
