140
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:12,110
Did he just read my thoughts ?

141
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:16,910
Celestial Emperor Qing Lin's jade slip recorded the Shadow Escape.

142
00:09:17,680 --> 00:09:19,560
But it can only be used by a Celestial Guard...

143
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,510
It might be my chance to escape.

144
00:09:22,360 --> 00:09:24,150
Although the success rate of refining one is slim,

145
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,270
I have no choice but to try.

146
00:09:27,720 --> 00:09:28,870
You have one chance.

147
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,470
If you can reach Ascendant,

148
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:33,870
I will grant you a great fortune

149
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:36,350
to help you reach Illusory Yin and Corporeal Yang.

150
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:38,390
But the condition is

151
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:41,750
that you will let me refine you into a Celestial Guard

152
00:09:42,400 --> 00:09:44,110
and serve me for 1000 years.

153
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,950
A Celestial Guard ?

154
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:48,080
Will I retain my consciousness ?

155
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,320
If you're still alive in 1000 years,

156
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:52,750
I will give you back your freedom and your consciousness.

157
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,110
I will gamble !

158
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,150
I will gamble on me living 1000 years !

159
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,400
Alright,

160
00:10:01,040 --> 00:10:01,750
I am willing !

161
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:06,750
Now that he's Ascendant,

162
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,160
he's ready to become a Celestial Guard.

163
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,510
Next,

164
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:12,790
I must refine his physical body.

165
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:25,830
Unfortunately,

166
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,310
he only achieved copper-rank strength...

167
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,710
Since his body is too weak,

168
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,830
I'll have to borrow the Heavenly Ghosts' strength.

169
00:11:35,150 --> 00:11:40,280
Note: Wang Lin obtained the Heavenly Ghost from Luo Yun of the Heavenly Ghost Sect when he arrived in the Demon Spirit Land.

170
00:11:42,240 --> 00:11:42,680
Refine !

171
00:12:01,080 --> 00:12:04,080
6 months later

172
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:12,880
Celestial Guard Du Jian
Illusory Yin

173
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,150
An Illusory Yin puppet !

174
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,390
Celestial Emperor Qing Lin truly had impressive means.

175
00:12:16,760 --> 00:12:17,350
Conceal !

176
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:21,520
With the Celestial Guard's Shadow Escape,

177
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,470
I have a 60% chance to leave this place.

178
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,950
When the token was taking shape,

179
00:12:27,160 --> 00:12:28,750
I failed to get the last sword.

180
00:12:29,480 --> 00:12:31,110
If my guess is correct,

181
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,750
