186
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,630
I obtained 7 of the 12 Swords' swords.

187
00:12:49,000 --> 00:12:51,000
With them, I can use the Seven Star Sword Formation.

188
00:12:51,840 --> 00:12:53,550
If I also channel it with Divine Retribution Lightning,

189
00:12:54,760 --> 00:12:56,440
it will become even stronger !

190
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,470
Just these artifacts

191
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:03,510
