192
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,710
Maybe...

193
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,350
Wealth...

194
00:13:09,400 --> 00:13:10,430
Let me have a look

195
00:13:10,560 --> 00:13:12,430
