202
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:46,350
The sentient beings...

203
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:48,310
The words 'Chopping the net'...

204
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:51,390
What's the connection between them ?

205
00:14:07,680 --> 00:14:10,560
3 years later

206
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,200
Chopping the net...

207
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,470
What does 'Chopping the net' mean ?

208
00:14:29,800 --> 00:14:31,070
I get it !

209
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:33,590
The heavens are a net.

210
00:14:34,760 --> 00:14:35,870
All sentient beings

211
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,640
are intertwined in a myriad of ways.

212
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:40,750
We are all bound by the rules of the heavens and the earth.

213
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,670
From birth to death,

214
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,030
we all live in a net.

215
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:47,790
And the Heavenly Chop

216
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:50,310
severs this very net of heaven and earth.

217
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,390
It severs

218
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:55,270
the rules that govern all sentient beings !

219
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:04,270
Once this sword is used,

220
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:06,430
it can sever one's destiny

221
00:15:08,240 --> 00:15:09,550
and defy the rules !

222
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:12,080
This is

223
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:14,510
the Heavenly Chop !

224
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:15,640
Heavenly Chop

225
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,560
Sever !

226
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:40,990
In just a few years,

227
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:43,350
the suction force has increased a lot.

228
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:45,470
Could there be something else

229
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,790
at the bottom of the Abyss ?

230
00:15:48,720 --> 00:15:50,430
I painstakingly comprehended the Heavenly Chop

231
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:52,750
