233
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,190
Fate...

234
00:15:59,160 --> 00:15:59,990
Destiny...

235
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:03,270
Everyone’s happiness is different…

236
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:05,750
What I seek

237
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:08,510
is to accompany my parents,

238
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,590
to accompany Wan'er...

239
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:15,830
Yet the Dao I have chosen

240
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:19,310
is one of solitude.

241
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:23,190
Since it has come to this,

242
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:25,990
I won't overthink it.

243
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,430
I might as well use the time I have

244
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:32,070
to extract the slaughter energy from my body.

245
00:16:49,000 --> 00:16:51,070
The Life Seals are just a manifestation

246
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:55,590
