247
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:07,310
It's bearable

248
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:09,470
but not enough !

249
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:14,590
Suction force,

250
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:16,110
come at me !

251
00:17:20,080 --> 00:17:21,430
Show yourselves !

252
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:25,950
1 083 222 strands of slaughter energy,

253
00:17:27,000 --> 00:17:29,590
the exact same number of Life Seals I have.

254
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,710
The suction force isn't strong enough...

255
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,350
Celestial Guard,

256
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:56,520
Shadow Escape !

257
00:18:34,080 --> 00:18:36,480
6 months later

258
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,870
My million Life Seals

259
00:18:58,400 --> 00:19:00,390
