260
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:16,630
Greed !

261
00:19:17,280 --> 00:19:19,230
I ordered you to protect my disciples !

262
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:21,030
How could they have died like this !?

263
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,270
The compass has been giving frequent warnings lately.

264
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:35,550
Xi Xue...

265
00:19:36,680 --> 00:19:39,070
What exactly have you encountered ?

266
00:19:39,600 --> 00:19:41,430
Fellow cultivators,

267
00:19:41,960 --> 00:19:44,990
I wish to advance the opening of the Demon Spirit Land

268
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:46,590
by 10 years.

269
00:19:47,680 --> 00:19:49,630
Does anyone have any objections ?

270
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:50,750
I agree.

271
00:19:50,880 --> 00:19:51,550
I agree !

272
00:19:54,360 --> 00:19:55,390
Wang Lin,

273
00:19:55,760 --> 00:19:58,630
you dared to forcibly remove the Life Seals.

274
00:19:59,360 --> 00:20:00,830
Since that's the case,

275
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:03,750
I can't let you live.

276
00:20:06,120 --> 00:22:39,960
Celestial Guards are split into the following ranks: gold, silver, copper, iron. Gold being the strongest and iron being the weakest.

277
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:32,480
Ask

278
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:30,400
Qi Condensation

279
00:20:29,520 --> 00:20:32,560
the perilous path filled with countless blades.

